    "created_at": "2017-09-19T17:19:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-19T17:19:52Z",
    "body": "I won't be at TPAC this year. If you think this would be easier to communicate through voice I'm happy to join some call, provided it's a somewhat convenient time for Europeans (I'm generally available 9AM-5PM or 7PM-9PM, Zürich time).\r\n\r\nQuestions:\r\n\r\n1. If an application handling a payment transaction cannot be interrupted, is that because of a flaw in the application? How would you envision that to be solved?\r\n2. Why can AT not give the user a quick way to defer notifications et al?",
