    "body": "Peter, your participation would be most welcome. And, Anne, your need to be present for the birth of your child certainly takes precedence! Let's hold for the 11th for now. I'm also juggling availability of W3C people. But, if we need to postpone--even last minute--we can do that. I will post a URI to the agenda a few days ahead of the call. We use Webex with password, and need to ensure the passwords don't become visible, so I'll need an email address for that bit.",
