    "created_at": "2017-10-12T14:01:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-10-12T14:01:25Z",
    "body": "The conclusion was that we should advice users agents to give users sufficiently control over the flow of notifications. For instance, by perhaps not unduly distracting users when the user agent knows they are otherwise occupied (e.g., via a web site using a payments API).",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
